; PANOPLY COAT (design rulings 2-3). One hidden BuffResistDamage, applied for the scene by the trait;
; its script admits only attacks from beyond Range 10. Extended Zone Control's applicator shape.
; The hidden ATTACK PRE reaction records where each attack at the Pier was made from, before its own
; Knockback can move the Pier (close review, 2026-09-25). No pressable.
; SP3: one glyph family; the buff stays hidden, so only the Kit wears it.
[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_applicator"]
script = ExtResource("3_applicator")
applied_buffs = Array[ExtResource("2_buff")]([ExtResource("5_coat")])

